{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "Prix carburants",
  "description": {
    "en": "Follow the price of your fuel at the petrol stations near you, from official open data.",
    "fr": "Suivez le prix de votre carburant dans les stations-service proches de chez vous."
  },
  "version": "1.0.7",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/prohand/gladys-prixcarburants:1.0.7",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.0",
  "location": true,
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prohand/gladys-prixcarburants/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["energy"],
  "transports": ["cloud"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "How it works",
        "fr": "Comment ça marche"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Choose your country, your postal code and the fuel you use, then open the Discovery tab: the petrol stations around you appear there with their current price. Add the ones you want to follow, delete them when you no longer need them. Data comes from the official open data, no account and no API key needed.",
        "fr": "Choisissez votre pays, votre code postal et votre carburant, puis ouvrez l'onglet Découverte : les stations-service proches y apparaissent avec leur prix actuel. Ajoutez celles que vous voulez suivre, supprimez-les quand vous n'en avez plus besoin. Les données viennent de l'open data officiel, sans compte ni clé d'API."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.prix-carburants.gouv.fr/rubrique/opendata/",
          "label": {
            "en": "France: prix-carburants.gouv.fr open data",
            "fr": "France : open data prix-carburants.gouv.fr"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/prix-des-carburants-en-france-flux-instantane-v2/",
          "label": {
            "en": "France: the dataset queried by this integration",
            "fr": "France : le jeu de données interrogé par cette intégration"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "country",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Country",
        "fr": "Pays"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Country whose open data is queried. More countries will be added in future versions.",
        "fr": "Pays dont l'open data est interrogé. D'autres pays seront ajoutés dans de prochaines versions."
      },
      "required": true,
      "default": "FR",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "FR",
          "label": {
            "en": "France",
            "fr": "France"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "postal_code",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Postal code",
        "fr": "Code postal"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Stations are searched around this postal code. In France, 5 digits.",
        "fr": "Les stations sont recherchées autour de ce code postal. En France, 5 chiffres."
      },
      "required": true,
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "35000",
        "fr": "35000"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "search_center",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Measure distances from",
        "fr": "Mesurer les distances depuis"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Your Gladys house is used when it has coordinates (the integration asks Gladys for them, and shows them nowhere). Otherwise the centre of the postal code area is used.",
        "fr": "Votre maison Gladys est utilisée si elle a des coordonnées (l'intégration les demande à Gladys et ne les affiche nulle part). Sinon, c'est le centre de la zone du code postal."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "house",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "house",
          "label": {
            "en": "My Gladys house",
            "fr": "Ma maison Gladys"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "postal_code",
          "label": {
            "en": "The postal code",
            "fr": "Le code postal"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "search_radius_km",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Search radius (km)",
        "fr": "Rayon de recherche (km)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Also look for stations around the postal code. 0 keeps only the stations of the postal code itself.",
        "fr": "Cherche aussi des stations autour du code postal. 0 ne garde que les stations du code postal lui-même."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 10,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50
    },
    {
      "key": "fuel_type",
      "type": "multi_select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Fuel type",
        "fr": "Type de carburant"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "One device is offered per station AND per selected fuel, so you can follow several fuels at the same station. A station only appears for the fuels it actually sells: many stations (TotalEnergies in particular) replaced SP95 with E10 (SP95-E10), so tick E10 if the SP95 of your station is nowhere to be found.",
        "fr": "Un appareil est proposé par station ET par carburant sélectionné, ce qui permet de suivre plusieurs carburants dans la même station. Une station n'apparaît que pour les carburants qu'elle vend vraiment : beaucoup de stations (TotalEnergies notamment) ont remplacé le SP95 par le E10 (SP95-E10), cochez donc E10 si le SP95 de votre station reste introuvable."
      },
      "required": true,
      "default": ["gazole"],
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "gazole",
          "label": {
            "en": "Diesel",
            "fr": "Gazole"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "sp95",
          "label": {
            "en": "SP95",
            "fr": "SP95"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "sp98",
          "label": {
            "en": "SP98",
            "fr": "SP98"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "e10",
          "label": {
            "en": "E10 (SP95-E10)",
            "fr": "E10 (SP95-E10)"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "e85",
          "label": {
            "en": "E85 (Superethanol)",
            "fr": "E85 (Superéthanol)"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "gplc",
          "label": {
            "en": "LPG",
            "fr": "GPLc"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "max_stations",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Maximum number of stations",
        "fr": "Nombre maximum de stations"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "How many stations the Discovery tab may list. Lower it in a dense city, raise it in the countryside.",
        "fr": "Nombre de stations que l'onglet Découverte peut lister. Baissez-le en ville dense, augmentez-le à la campagne."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 20,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 50
    },
    {
      "key": "poll_frequency",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Refresh interval (s)",
        "fr": "Intervalle de rafraîchissement (s)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "How often the price of each added station is refreshed. The French feed is updated about every 10 minutes; once an hour is plenty.",
        "fr": "Fréquence de rafraîchissement du prix de chaque station ajoutée. Le flux français est mis à jour environ toutes les 10 minutes ; une fois par heure suffit largement."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 3600,
      "min": 600,
      "max": 86400
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "search_stations",
      "label": {
        "en": "Preview the nearby stations",
        "fr": "Prévisualiser les stations proches"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 30
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_prices",
      "label": {
        "en": "Refresh the prices now",
        "fr": "Rafraîchir les prix maintenant"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "key": "best_prices",
      "label": {
        "en": "Cheapest around me",
        "fr": "Les moins chers"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The cheapest stations for one fuel, with the trend of the last 30 days.",
        "fr": "Les stations les moins chères pour un carburant, avec la tendance sur 30 jours."
      },
      "icon": "trending-down",
      "settings": [
        {
          "key": "fuel",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Fuel",
            "fr": "Carburant"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "The fuel this card ranks the stations for.",
            "fr": "Le carburant pour lequel cette carte classe les stations."
          },
          "default": "gazole",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "gazole",
              "label": {
                "en": "Diesel",
                "fr": "Gazole"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "sp95",
              "label": {
                "en": "SP95",
                "fr": "SP95"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "sp98",
              "label": {
                "en": "SP98",
                "fr": "SP98"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "e10",
              "label": {
                "en": "E10 (SP95-E10)",
                "fr": "E10 (SP95-E10)"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "e85",
              "label": {
                "en": "E85 (Superethanol)",
                "fr": "E85 (Superéthanol)"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "gplc",
              "label": {
                "en": "LPG",
                "fr": "GPLc"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "scope",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Stations",
            "fr": "Stations"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Search around the configured postal code, or rank only the stations you added.",
            "fr": "Chercher autour du code postal configuré, ou classer seulement les stations que vous avez ajoutées."
          },
          "default": "around",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "around",
              "label": {
                "en": "Around my postal code",
                "fr": "Autour de mon code postal"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "tracked",
              "label": {
                "en": "My stations only",
                "fr": "Mes stations seulement"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "count",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Stations shown",
            "fr": "Stations affichées"
          },
          "default": "5",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "3",
              "label": {
                "en": "3",
                "fr": "3"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "5",
              "label": {
                "en": "5",
                "fr": "5"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "8",
              "label": {
                "en": "8",
                "fr": "8"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "action_timeout_seconds": 60
    },
    {
      "key": "station",
      "label": {
        "en": "My station",
        "fr": "Ma station"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Every price of one station you follow, with its address.",
        "fr": "Tous les prix d’une station que vous suivez, avec son adresse."
      },
      "icon": "map-pin",
      "settings": [
        {
          "key": "device",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Station",
            "fr": "Station"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "One of the stations you added from the Discovery tab.",
            "fr": "Une des stations que vous avez ajoutées depuis l’onglet Découverte."
          }
        }
      ],
      "action_timeout_seconds": 60
    }
  ],
  "scene_triggers": [
    {
      "key": "price_updated",
      "label": {
        "en": "A fuel price changed",
        "fr": "Un prix de carburant a changé"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A station you follow declared a new price. The event carries the previous price and the difference, which a device feature alone cannot give.",
        "fr": "Une station que vous suivez a déclaré un nouveau prix. L'événement porte l'ancien prix et l'écart, ce qu'une donnée d'appareil seule ne peut pas donner."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "device",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Station",
            "fr": "Station"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Leave empty to react to every station you follow.",
            "fr": "Laissez vide pour réagir à toutes les stations que vous suivez."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "fuel",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Fuel",
            "fr": "Carburant"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Leave empty for any fuel.",
            "fr": "Laissez vide pour tous les carburants."
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "gazole",
              "label": {
                "en": "Diesel",
                "fr": "Gazole"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "sp95",
              "label": {
                "en": "SP95",
                "fr": "SP95"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "sp98",
              "label": {
                "en": "SP98",
                "fr": "SP98"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "e10",
              "label": {
                "en": "E10 (SP95-E10)",
                "fr": "E10 (SP95-E10)"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "e85",
              "label": {
                "en": "E85 (Superethanol)",
                "fr": "E85 (Superéthanol)"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "gplc",
              "label": {
                "en": "LPG",
                "fr": "GPLc"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "direction",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Direction",
            "fr": "Sens"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Leave empty for both.",
            "fr": "Laissez vide pour les deux."
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "down",
              "label": {
                "en": "The price went down",
                "fr": "Le prix a baissé"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "up",
              "label": {
                "en": "The price went up",
                "fr": "Le prix a augmenté"
              }
